  lineArray:
  - speaker: 1
    text: Amazing work! with the way you're farming, the rest of the village will be talking about your field soon.
    playerEmote: 0
    npcEmote: 6
    isShaking: 0
    isNpcGlaring: 0
    focusNpcSO: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: 0
    text: I still can't believe it actually works.
    playerEmote: 14
    npcEmote: 0
    isShaking: 0
    isNpcGlaring: 0
    focusNpcSO: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: 1
    text: Believe it, partner. Anyway, I will be leaving an ICAN issued crate later. you can use it to sell your hard earned crops.
    playerEmote: 0
    npcEmote: 1
    isShaking: 0
    isNpcGlaring: 1
    focusNpcSO: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: 1
    text: Well, I've got other farmers to help. Until next time!
    playerEmote: 0
    npcEmote: 5
    isShaking: 0
    isNpcGlaring: 0
    focusNpcSO: {fileID: 0}
